{"t":"GOOGL","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Alphabet Inc.","ko":"알파벳","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","employees":204757,"hq":"Mountain View, CA, United States","website":"https://abc.xyz","summary_en":"Alphabet Inc. offers various products and platforms in the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia-Pacific, Canada, and Latin America. It operates through Google Services, Google Cloud, and Other Bets segments. The Google Services segment provides products and services, including ads, Android, Chrome, devices, Gmail, Google Drive, Google Maps, Google Photos, Google Play, Search, and YouTube. It is also involved in the sale of apps and in-app purchases and digital content in Google Play and YouTube; and devices, as well as the provision of YouTube consumer subscription services, such as YouTube TV, YouTube Music and Premium, NFL Sunday Ticket, and Google One. The Google Cloud segment offers consumption-based fees and subscriptions for AI solutions, including AI infrastructure, Vertex AI platform, and Gemini enterprise. It also provides cybersecurity, and data and analytics services; Google Workspace that include cloud-based communication and collaboration tools for enterprises, such as Calendar, Gmail, Docs, Drive, and Meet; and other enterprise services. The Other Bets segment sells transportation and internet services. Alphabet Inc. was incorporated in 1998 and is headquartered in Mountain View, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Alphabet Inc.는 미국, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카, 아시아 태평양, 캐나다 및 라틴 아메리카에서 다양한 제품과 플랫폼을 제공합니다. Google 서비스, Google Cloud 및 기타 Bets 세그먼트를 통해 운영됩니다. Google 서비스 부문은 광고, Android, Chrome, 기기, Gmail, Google 드라이브, Google 지도, Google 포토, Google Play, 검색 및 YouTube를 포함한 제품과 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 Google Play 및 YouTube에서 앱, 인앱 구매, 디지털 콘텐츠 판매에도 관여합니다. YouTube TV, YouTube Music 및 Premium, NFL Sunday Ticket, Google One 등 YouTube 소비자 구독 서비스를 제공합니다. Google Cloud 부문은 AI 인프라, Vertex AI 플랫폼, Gemini Enterprise를 포함한 AI 솔루션에 대한 소비 기반 요금과 구독을 제공합니다. 또한 사이버 보안, 데이터 및 분석 서비스도 제공합니다. Calendar, Gmail, Docs, Drive, Meet 등 기업을 위한 클라우드 기반 커뮤니케이션 및 공동작업 도구가 포함된 Google Workspace 및 기타 엔터프라이즈 서비스. 기타 베팅 부문은 교통 및 인터넷 서비스를 판매합니다. Alphabet Inc.는 1998년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 마운틴뷰에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":288.15,"mcap":3542515974144.0,"pe":15.046997,"fpe":18.668476,"peg":1.0059,"ps":7.5197005,"pb":5.371323,"ev_ebitda":18.574,"div":0.31,"beta":1.226,"hi52":408.61,"lo52":270.7},"fin":{"rev":471097999360.0,"rev_g":0.247,"eps_g":-0.253,"gross":0.60857,"op":0.31805,"net":0.50031,"roe":0.44286,"fcf":-1162499968.0,"cash":265098002432.0,"debt":150330998784.0,"de":22.187,"eps":19.15,"feps":15.43511},"own":{"short":0.013300001,"inst":0.80629,"insider":0.01594},"analyst":{"n":53,"mean":400.37357,"median":400.0,"high":500.0,"low":300.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.34483,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":10,"buy":43,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":10,"buy":43,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":13,"buy":44,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":13,"buy":45,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":365.0,"priorPriceTarget":371.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":375.0,"priorPriceTarget":447.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":371.0,"priorPriceTarget":417.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":325.0,"priorPriceTarget":385.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":